OL,3,GNEWSAYour questions answered as        
OL,4,Ahospital stops use of gas and air      
OL,6,FGas and air will no longer be offered  
OL,7,Fto women giving birth at Basildon      
OL,8,FHospital's maternity unit as a form of 
OL,9,Fpain relief.                           
OL,11,FLocal NHS leaders feared persistently  
OL,12,Fhigh levels of nitrous oxide gas       
OL,13,Fcontained in the substance, also known 
OL,14,Fas Entonox, could be causing health    
OL,15,Fissues among staff in the unit.        
OL,17,FIt was revealed last month that 121    
OL,18,Fmembers of staff had sued Mid and South
OL,19,FEssex NHS Trust over their exposure and
OL,20,Freceived payouts totalling #735,000.   
